 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "InMemoryDB() starts empty. Records are addressed by key and hold field-value pairs (all strings). setData(key, field, value) stores value in the field, replacing an existing value and creating the record when needed. getData(key, field) returns the stored value, or \"\" when the record or field is absent. deleteData(key, field) removes the field and returns true, or returns false when the record or field is absent. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
